  "title": "What is the pricing for cord blood banking?",
  "summary": "Cord blood banking at Anja Health is designed to make stem cell preservation more accessible, supportive, and comprehensive for families. Unlike many traditional cord blood banks that focus only on cord blood and cord tissue, Anja Health also offers placenta banking, giving parents the option to preserve a wider variety of stem cells.",
